</span></h3><p class="sc-TtZnY fPBQTR pf-151_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eGJWMs gQYBcx pf-153_">Photographed is "<span style="font-weight: bold;">Benjamin Button's</span>", a 5 year old Australian Shepherd after his first AKC Scent Trial. "<span style="font-weight: bold;">Benjamin</span>" loves scent work and loves showing off his ribbons. "<span style="font-weight: bold;">Benjamin</span>" is also a therapy dog and has his own Facebook page (Benjamin Button's the Australian Shepherd). He will use his prize money for more trials to show off his beautiful ribbons and rosettes.
